#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Deploy the Supervisor for Claude pack into a Claude Code config dir (default: profile ~/.config/claude-supervisor).

Subcommands: install | update | status | list | uninstall | migrate | doctor | critic.  Run `deploy <cmd> --help`.
A profile can use an API provider instead of a subscription: install --provider or --base-url, with --model-<tier>.

Ownership model: every installed file is recorded in a manifest with the
hash it had when installed (the "baseline").  On re-install each file is
reconciled three ways (source / target / baseline) so local edits are never
silently overwritten and unmanaged files are never clobbered.
"""

